Journey: The settlement statement PDF agrees with the claim screen and the database
Id: statement-pdf-three-way
Tags: @documents @portal @integration @regression
Role: policyholder
Risk: 5
Requirements: DOC-1, DOC-2

Run code "steps/claims.steps.ts#seedApprovedClaim" with policyId="POL-H-100231", type="FIRE", amount="7300", approved="6880.55" as seeded
Set variable claimId to seeded.claimId

Log in
Open /app/claims/${claimId}
  Expect testid=claim-status has text "Approved"
Capture the text of testid=claim-policy as claimPolicy
Capture the text of testid=claim-approved as claimApproved
Capture the text of testid=claim-payout as claimPayout
Expect ${claimPayout} == ${seeded.payout}
Download the "Download statement" link as statement
Expect the download statement is named "statement-${claimId}.pdf"
Expect the download statement has type "pdf"

# Field by field, PDF vs screen vs database; the statement's lines must foot to the settlement amount
Compare document statement to the claim using statement-vs-claim and store as statementCheck

Run code "steps/claims.steps.ts#removeClaim" with claimId="${claimId}" as cleanup
